{{also|Dinsdag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|dinsendach}}. Probably from {{der|nl|gem-pro|*þingsus-dagaz|t=Day of Thingsus}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*þingsus}} + {{m|gem-pro|*dagaz}}. {{m|la|Thingsus}}, {{m|ang|Tiw}} or {{m|non|Týr}} was the name of the {{der|nl|gem|-}} god of justice.

Compare Low German {{m|nds-de|Dingsdag}} and German {{m|de|Dienstag}}.

